1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,000
Apa jadi bila anak salah?

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:07,200
Anak tersilap Pecahan. App terangkan kenapa, tanpa terus beri jawapan.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:12,400
Dan app tak terus tukar topik. Pecahan datang balik, kali ni guna set objek.

4
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:17,400
Pecahan lagi, dalam bentuk ayat… dan kali ni, betul!

5
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,500
Betul lagi, sendiri.

6
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:25,200
Faham dulu… baru menang besar!

7
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:30,800
Salah? Topik sama datang balik. Cara soalan bertukar. Bila dah betul berturut-turut, baru naik ke kemahiran seterusnya.

8
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:33,900
Masih belum kukuh? Kemahiran Fokus bawa anak…

9
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:39,800
…ke dunia Pecahan sendiri. Topik sama, cara lebih seronok.

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,800
Pahlawan Angka. Faham anak anda.
